source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: The escaped token leaves a single backslash in the heading rather than the forced newline a bare pair would render.
-- input.jira --
h1. \\(x)
-- rendered.html --
<h1><a name="%5C%5C%28x%29"></a>\(x)</h1>
-- want.md --
# \\(x)
-- warnings.json --
[]
